{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1326672000, "end_date": 1327363199, "month_true_total": 61, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:45:29 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2630499", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010242461", "personaname": "ReaperM13", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ReaperM13/", "num_games_owned": 198, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2665, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2249, "last_played": 1668357484, "avatar": "a64e32a30325cd5e327de9186fe3242dc2ef1dc7"}, "language": "english", "review": "One bad ass game", "timestamp_created": 1327165865, "timestamp_updated": 1327165865, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4348487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035820191", "personaname": "superb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/superb420/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 836, "last_played": 1392500520, "avatar": "4e67e22e56aafa8ae9725707efbc58e05349949a"}, "language": "english", "review": "When SM came out months ago, I really was interested, but simply didn't want to shell out the $50 for it. At the time, I wasn't a huge Warhammer 40K fan, but I actually am now.\n\nSM has a little bit for everyone. It has a fun story mode, a good \"horde mode\" game for your coop buddies, and a quite fun multiplayer! All the while, SM has enough blood and gore for everyone!\n\nOne of the major complaints of SM was the p2p multiplayer hosting. Players normally complain of lag, but seemingly those are greifs of the past, I've had 1 lag situation (the very first time I played online) and that was it! \n\nSpace Marine is for those who love a good 3rd person shooter similiar to Gears of War, I'm really pleased with the game and still enjoy it regularly!", "timestamp_created": 1327154972, "timestamp_updated": 1327154972, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5698358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054298226", "personaname": "Dik_Koks", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dik_Koks/", "num_games_owned": 992, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 10634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10358, "last_played": 1559041298, "avatar": "0ab8c0fcc43ec292cf62b560540f8ad66b333041"}, "language": "english", "review": "Мне очень нравится!", "timestamp_created": 1327038496, "timestamp_updated": 1327038496, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "546725", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971969377", "personaname": "CaptainColl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971969377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2918, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2478, "last_played": 1521831505, "avatar": "9a2d6123b2a2c18431b858ad99b71c45fd68582c"}, "language": "english", "review": "PURE LIQUID AWESOMENESS IN POWER ARMOR! :D", "timestamp_created": 1327004762, "timestamp_updated": 1327004762, "voted_up": true, "vote